#: src/components/empty-state/use-create-suggestions.ts
msgid "Build a knowledge wiki about the different types of flightless birds. Start with an overview page, then add cross-linked pages for each major group (ratites like ostriches, emus, and kiwis; penguins; and flightless rails), the regions they live in, and a timeline of how flightlessness evolved."
msgstr "建立一個關於各種不會飛的鳥類的知識維基。先寫一頁總覽，再為每個主要類群（鴕鳥、鴯鶓、奇異鳥等平胸鳥；企鵝；以及不會飛的秧雞）、牠們分布的區域，以及失去飛行能力的演化時間軸，加上互相連結的頁面。"

